---
description: Enforce compatibility gates before OTA publication and channel promotion
alwaysApply: true
---

compatibility-gates:

- Run local compatibility check script before publishing to shared channels.
- Run `capgo bundle compatibility <appId> --channel <targetChannel>` before upload and before promotion.
- Run `capgo bundle releaseType <appId> --channel <targetChannel>` and block OTA if output is `native`.
- Verify Capacitor package major alignment and updater plugin presence before rollout.
- Confirm `CapacitorUpdater` config exists and startup readiness notification is implemented.
- If compatibility fails, output exact blockers and required remediation, not generic guidance.
- Never promote to production channel without passing compatibility gates.
